/*
================================================================================
VELOCITY X - Master Material: M_Concrete_Barrier_Master
Asset Path: /Game/Materials/Barriers/M_Concrete_Barrier_Master
Target Use: New Jersey highway median barriers, bridge abutments, crash cushions

PBR SPECIFICATION & PARAMETER REGISTRY:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. BASE COLOR (Albedo):
   - Param "Concrete_Tint" (LinearColor, Default=(0.62, 0.60, 0.58, 1.0)):
     Weathered structural precast concrete.
   - Param "Dirt_Splash_Tint" (LinearColor, Default=(0.28, 0.22, 0.16, 1.0)):
     Highway grime / rainwater wheel splash along lower 40cm of barrier.
   - Param "Splash_Gradient_Height" (Scalar, Default=45.0 cm):
     Vertical gradient start height.

2. ROUGHNESS & METALLIC:
   - Param "Roughness_Dry" (Scalar, Default=0.82): Porous concrete surface.
   - Param "Roughness_Splash" (Scalar, Default=0.50): Smoother mud/grease residue.
   - Param "Metallic" (Scalar, Default=0.0): Dielectric.

3. NORMAL & EDGE DAMAGE:
   - Param "Formwork_Normal_Intensity" (Scalar, Default=0.8):
     Horizontal wooden/steel mold seams and form tie holes.
   - Param "Chip_Damage_Intensity" (Scalar, Default=1.2):
     Corner and top edge impact spalling.
   - Param "Tiling_U" (Scalar, Default=4.0):
   - Param "Tiling_V" (Scalar, Default=1.0):

4. REFLECTIVE STRIP / DELINEATOR:
   - Param "bHasDelineatorStripe" (StaticSwitch, Default=False):
   - Param "DelineatorColor" (LinearColor, Default=(1.0, 0.8, 0.0, 1.0)):
   - Param "DelineatorEmissive" (Scalar, Default=0.0): Unlit retroreflectivity.
================================================================================
